  "description": "A platform-agnostic, pure-IL 64-bit build of libxmp 4.7.4 with a C# wrapper. Plays tracker modules (MOD, XM, IT, S3M, MED, DBM, FAR, MTM, PTM, 669, ULT, MDL, GDM and the rest) and renders 16-bit stereo PCM with no native code and no P/Invoke.",
