  "readmeFile": "PACKAGE.md",
  "releaseNotes": "libxmp 4.7.4 compiled to IL with llvm-msil. 4.7.4.1 ships the platform-neutral header (Machine=I386, PE32, ILOnly) so the same assembly loads on x64 and arm64, and adds the 64-bit guard, arm64 and 32-bit test coverage. cf. THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md for the exact source revision and patches.",
